      "created_at": "2014-08-13T15:56:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Matchstickman\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/48/1880_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Matchstickman:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Rabit wrote:</b><br><blockquote>You can go straight to <a href=\"http://sentineltactics.com/downloads\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">the downloads page </a>to get it.My bet is they took down the front page while they work on the details and clean it up.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nYou're reading my comment wrong, the download link is broken, not the link I posted.But I could have worded my post more clearly.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Actually, the communications are also being confused by different experiences. For me, <a href=\"http://sentineltactics.com/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">the front page </a>wasn't loading (although now it is), but I can get to <a href=\"http://sentineltactics.com/downloads\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">the downloads page </a>and <a href=\"http://sentineltactics.com/system/files/downloads/Sentinel%20Tactics%20Rulebook.pdf\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">the link to the rulebook</a> works just fine.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/open_mouth.png?v=12\" title=\":open_mouth:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":open_mouth:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>I have no idea if that's because of my access as a Mod (which doesn't seem likely - we really don't have much more access behind-the-scenes than normal users) or something else.</p>",
